pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-accent-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: gradient
      gradientType: linear
      angle: 0
      stops:
        - {position: 0, color: "#00D4AA00"}
        - {position: 0.3, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 0.7, color: "$primary"}
        - {position: 1, color: "#00D4AA00"}
  - elementId: corner-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 50, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 600, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>痛点：智能家居的现实困境</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 130, 360, 480]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-icon-1
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 150, 40, 40]
    iconName: "fas:ban"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: card-title-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 200, 320, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>生态割据</p>
  - elementId: card-divider-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 245, 60, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: card-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 265, 320, 320]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>不同品牌各自封闭，APP互不联通。用户需要安装多个独立应用，体验碎片化。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">• 小米、华为、苹果等生态互相隔离</p>
        <p>• 设备无法跨品牌协同工作</p>
        <p>• 用户被迫在多个APP间切换</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 130, 360, 480]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-icon-2
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [480, 150, 40, 40]
    iconName: "fas:eye-slash"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: card-title-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 200, 320, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>存量盲区</p>
  - elementId: card-divider-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [480, 245, 60, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: card-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 265, 320, 320]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>红外空调、普通灯具等传统设备无法智能化，被排除在智能家居之外。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">• 存量家电占家庭设备80%以上</p>
        <p>• 红外遥控设备无法联网</p>
        <p>• 传统灯具缺乏智能接口</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 130, 360, 480]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF15"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    shadow:
      blur: 12
      color: "#00000040"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: card-icon-3
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [880, 150, 40, 40]
    iconName: "fas:coins"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: card-title-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 200, 320, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum, siyuanSongti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>高成本门槛</p>
  - elementId: card-divider-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [880, 245, 60, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: card-body-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 265, 320, 320]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>全量更换智能设备需数千元，普通家庭难以承受。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">• 智能空调均价3000+元</p>
        <p>• 智能灯具、开关全屋更换</p>
        <p>• 安装调试人工费用高昂</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 680, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF30"
    opacity: 0.3
  - elementId: bottom-tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 200, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>MIMICLAW</p>
  - elementId: bottom-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>02 / 12</p>
